direction: down
source: "Scheme semantic owner\nactual handler + denv + wind identities\nclassify transfer before hooks"
local: "Local callback control domain\nreturn / returning handler / local k\nretain conversion and marker rules"
cross: "Crosses Tcl native frontier\nraw escape / delayed rethrow\nno universal equivalence proof"
source -> local
source -> cross
preserve: "Conditional preservation\nsame observable hook / handler / Tcl trace\ncomplete roots and native capabilities"
local -> preserve
result: "Explicit new result API\nTcl completion authority OR\nnamed host-outcome authority"
cross -> result
cancel: "Explicit Tcl cancel-unwind\nstronger than plain TCL_ERROR\ncooperative interpreter scope"
cross -> cancel
open: "No hidden semantic weakening\nwind order / catch / event destination\nand progress still require proof"
result -> open
cancel -> open
